{"sha": "e204d17629b3442acf309c8b9012baea1e8103de59f80dfc08603db21383ee98", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:quantum-world} 章 --- 量子世界：光子与能级}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:1}", "$E = hc/\\lambda = \\num{1.99e-25}/\\num{5.30e-7} = \\qty{3.75e-19}{J} =", "\\qty{2.35}{eV}$. $N = \\num{1.0e-3}/\\num{3.75e-19} \\approx \\num{2.7e15}$", "每秒光子数。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:2}", "$E = h\\nu = 6.63\\times10^{-34} \\times 10^{8} = \\qty{6.63e-26}{J}", "\\approx \\qty{4.1e-7}{eV}$ --- 约为一个可见光光子能量的", "五百万分之一。任何可探测的无线电信号都", "包含每秒如此多的光子，因而其光流十分平滑。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:3}", "$\\nu_0 = W_0/h = \\num{3.04e-19}/\\num{6.63e-34} \\approx", "\\qty{4.6e14}{Hz}$；$\\lambda_0 = c/\\nu_0 \\approx \\qty{654}{nm}$。取", "\\qty{633}{nm}，$E = 1240/633 = \\qty{1.96}{eV} > \\qty{1.9}{eV}$：能，", "勉强，此时 $E_{k,\\max} \\approx \\qty{0.06}{eV} \\approx \\qty{1e-20}{J}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:4}", "$E_3 - E_2 = -1.51 + 3.40 = \\qty{1.89}{eV}$;", "$\\lambda = 1240/1.89 \\approx \\qty{656}{nm}$：即红色谱线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:5}", "$\\nu_0 \\approx \\qty{5.6e14}{Hz}$; $W_0 = h\\nu_0 \\approx", "\\qty{3.7e-19}{J} \\approx \\qty{2.3}{eV}$（即 $-W_0$ 截距）。", "斜率即普朗克常量 $h$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:6}", "$E = 1240/400 = \\qty{3.10}{eV}$; $E_{k,\\max} = 3.10 - 2.3 =", "\\qty{0.80}{eV} = \\qty{1.3e-19}{J}$; $U_s = E_{k,\\max}/e =", "\\qty{0.80}{V}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:7}", "光强加倍：电流加倍（光子数加倍），$U_s$", "不变（每个光子能量相同）。频率升高：$U_s$ 增大，", "$E_{k,\\max} = h\\nu - W_0$。波动图像将电子的能量", "与光强相联系，而与频率无关——这恰恰是\\emph{不}", "被观察到的现象。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:8}", "从 $n = 1$ 出发：\\qty{13.6}{eV}，$\\lambda = 1240/13.6 \\approx", "\\qty{91}{nm}$，远紫外线。从 $n = 2$ 出发：\\qty{3.40}{eV}，", "$\\lambda \\approx \\qty{365}{nm}$，近紫外线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:9}", "从基态出发，最小跃迁所需能量为 $E_2 - E_1 =", "\\qty{10.2}{eV}$（\\qty{122}{nm}）：所有吸收谱线均", "为紫外线，无一可见。在热的恒星大气中，碰撞使", "部分原子处于 $n = 2$，从而能吸收可见的", "巴耳末光子（\\qtyrange{1.89}{3.40}{eV}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:10}", "(a) $E_k = \\qty{1.6e-17}{J}$, $p = \\sqrt{2m_e E_k} =", "\\qty{5.4e-24}{kg.m/s}$, $\\lambda = h/p \\approx \\qty{1.2e-10}{m}$ ---", "原子尺度：晶体能使其发生衍射。(b) $p = \\num{1.0e-4} \\times 1.0 =", "\\qty{1.0e-4}{kg.m/s}$, $\\lambda \\approx \\qty{6.6e-30}{m}$ --- $10^{20}$", "倍（比原子小），这只苍蝇的波永远不可见。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:11}", "一个光子：$\\num{1.99e-25}/\\num{5.05e-7} = \\qty{3.94e-19}{J}$；九十个光子：", "$\\approx \\qty{3.5e-17}{J}$。蚊子：$\\tfrac12 \\times \\num{2.5e-6}", "\\times 0.50^2 = \\qty{3.1e-7}{J}$ --- $10^{10}$ 倍。人眼", "工作时距绝对极限仅相差百余个", "光子，几乎就是一台光子计数器。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:12}", "$\\nu_1 = \\qty{7.41e14}{Hz}$, $\\nu_2 = \\qty{5.49e14}{Hz}$;", "$h = e\\,\\Delta U_s/\\Delta\\nu = \\num{1.60e-19} \\times 0.79 /", "\\num{1.91e14} \\approx \\qty{6.6e-34}{J.s}$. $W_0 = h\\nu_2 - eU_{s,2} =", "\\num{3.63e-19} - \\num{0.64e-19} = \\qty{3.0e-19}{J} \\approx", "\\qty{1.9}{eV}$：铯。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:13}", "$1240/486 = \\qty{2.55}{eV} = E_4 - E_2 = 3.40 - 0.85$：跃迁", "$4 \\to 2$. $1240/434 = \\qty{2.86}{eV} = E_5 - E_2 = 3.40 - 0.54$:", "跃迁 $5 \\to 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:14}", "横截面 $\\pi r^2 \\approx \\qty{3.1e-20}{m^2}$，收集的功率", "$\\qty{3.1e-26}{W}$; $t = \\num{3.7e-19}/\\num{3.1e-26} \\approx", "\\qty{1.2e7}{s}$ --- 约四个月，而观测到的时间不足一纳秒。", "能量无法在波前上均匀铺开：它", "集中地以颗粒形式传播。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:quantum-world:15}", "$E_k = \\qty{8.0e-16}{J}$, $p = \\sqrt{2m_e E_k} =", "\\qty{3.8e-23}{kg.m/s}$, $\\lambda = h/p \\approx \\qty{1.7e-11}{m} =", "\\qty{17}{pm}$ --- 比 \\qty{550}{nm} 约短 $\\num{3e4}$ 倍。", "衍射会使小于 $\\sim\\lambda$ 的细节变模糊，因此", "将 $\\lambda$ 缩小 $10^4$ 倍，分辨率便提高 $10^4$ 倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:quantum-world:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $E = hc/\\lambda = \\num{1.99e-25}/\\num{5.50e-7} =", "\\qty{3.62e-19}{J} = \\qty{2.26}{eV}$.", ""]}